  "reasons": [
    "Because management pre-announced postpaid account net additions of about 250,000, the subscriber dip is already priced, so the print is decided by EPS against the 2.98 bar.",
    "Because SpaceX must still build its network and win customers, its spectrum purchase takes no T-Mobile revenue this quarter, so the 7.7% one-day drop is a headline discount.",
    "Because August's raised adjusted free cash flow guidance funds buybacks, the share count falls and EPS rises even on flat revenue; at 9.7x free cash flow the market prices no buyback."
