    "Postpaid account net additions: at or above the guided ~250,000 confirms the dip is self-inflicted; materially below breaks it.",
    "Service revenue: holding near Q2's 7.9% total revenue growth confirms; an outright year-over-year decline breaks the cash case.",
    "Adjusted free cash flow guidance: maintained or raised confirms; any cut breaks the thesis outright.",
    "Fixed wireless net additions: holding share while industry additions slow confirms the broadband leg; a fall breaks it."
